                                          Whirling injections, surjections, and other
                                          functions between finite sets
                                                           Michael Joseph1                                           James Propp2                                        Tom Roby3
arXiv:1711.02411v6 [math.CO] 8 Dec 2025




                                               1
                                                 Dalton State College, Dalton, USA
                                               2
                                                 University of Massachusetts Lowell, Lowell, USA
